00:23:44.705 --> 00:23:47.572
Being still and doing nothing.


00:23:47.575 --> 00:23:49.702
Are two very different things.


00:23:53.547 --> 00:23:55.481
She used her chi on that snake, didn't
she?


00:23:55.516 --> 00:23:56.540
Very good.


00:23:56.550 --> 00:23:57.608
You gotta teach me that.


00:23:57.652 --> 00:23:58.710
Like... How to control people?


00:24:00.621 --> 00:24:03.454
There's only one person you need to learn
how to control


00:24:07.662 --> 00:24:08.629
Who?


00:24:10.498 --> 00:24:10.759
Empty your mind.


00:24:11.666 --> 00:24:13.566
Flow with my movements.


00:24:13.601 --> 00:24:15.535
Connect with the energy.


00:24:15.536 --> 00:24:16.628
Around it.


00:24:16.637 --> 00:24:18.605
I kindajust wanna learn the cobra thing.


00:24:18.639 --> 00:24:19.628
Cobra.


00:24:19.774 --> 00:24:21.503
Takes a life time.


00:24:21.676 --> 00:24:22.734
Requires great focus.


00:24:23.544 --> 00:24:24.568
But I have great focus.


00:24:26.514 --> 00:24:27.503
Whoo...


00:24:28.549 --> 00:24:29.516
Oh my God!


00:24:29.550 --> 00:24:30.517
Mr. Han.


00:24:30.551 --> 00:24:31.518
Your focus.


00:24:31.552 --> 00:24:32.610
Needs more focus.


00:24:33.621 --> 00:24:34.588
Mr. Han?


00:25:11.759 --> 00:25:13.624
Thank you, Mr. Han.


00:25:34.749 --> 00:25:37.718
There is no such thing as fortune cookies
in China.


00:25:38.552 --> 00:25:40.577
Dre, please be careful crossing the
street.


00:25:40.621 --> 00:25:43.488
You scared the life out of me the other
day.


00:25:43.524 --> 00:25:44.718
Pedestrians do not...


00:25:45.526 --> 00:25:46.652
Have the right away.


00:25:49.630 --> 00:25:51.621
And the symbols, I can't get the symbols
right.


00:25:51.665 --> 00:25:52.632
On the bathrooms.


00:25:52.666 --> 00:25:54.759
I still walk in the men's restroom.


00:25:54.769 --> 00:25:56.600
The other day I walked in.


00:25:56.637 --> 00:25:58.662
There was this ninety years old chinese
man.


00:25:58.672 --> 00:26:00.572
He thought he was gonna get a little
treat.


00:26:00.608 --> 00:26:01.632
Dre, please stop that! You look crazy.


00:26:01.675 --> 00:26:03.540
Here, eat your noodles!


00:26:26.667 --> 00:26:28.498
Mr. Han, what's going on?


00:26:31.539 --> 00:26:32.471
Anticipation.


00:26:33.707 --> 00:26:34.571
I can't...


00:26:35.609 --> 00:26:36.633
Don't see it.


00:26:36.644 --> 00:26:37.474
Feel it.


00:26:38.546 --> 00:26:39.478
Damn it, Mr. Han.


00:26:40.648 --> 00:26:41.580
I felt that one.


00:26:45.486 --> 00:26:46.544
- Mr. Han
- What?


00:26:52.593 --> 00:26:53.651
Concentrate.


00:26:54.528 --> 00:26:55.722
- Ok?
- Ok, do I get the stick now?


00:27:14.748 --> 00:27:15.544
Wow!


00:27:15.749 --> 00:27:16.613
Ouch.


00:27:17.551 --> 00:27:19.519
