- I'm ok.


00:27:23.624 --> 00:27:25.592
So, Mr. Han, what time are we training
tomorrow?


00:27:26.527 --> 00:27:28.586
Xiao Dre, we're not training tomorrow.


00:27:30.564 --> 00:27:31.588
Why not?


00:27:33.734 --> 00:27:35.759
- Wu ji bi fan.
- Wu ji bi fan.


00:27:36.470 --> 00:27:37.732
Means, too much something is not good.


00:27:40.508 --> 00:27:41.497
You need rest.


00:27:41.709 --> 00:27:43.472
A day off?


00:27:43.777 --> 00:27:44.744
Yes, Mr. Han.


00:27:45.546 --> 00:27:48.572
Yes, Xiao Dre needs to rest.


00:27:48.616 --> 00:27:50.607
Yes, Mr. Han.


00:27:50.651 --> 00:27:51.618
You rest too!


00:27:52.520 --> 00:27:53.578
Love you Mr. Han.


00:27:54.488 --> 00:27:55.455
Peace!


00:28:08.702 --> 00:28:09.669
Hey!


00:28:12.506 --> 00:28:15.600
- Are you ok?
- My audition is tomorrow at six.


00:28:15.643 --> 00:28:17.702
