00:28:27.588 --> 00:28:28.646
Meiying! Wait!


00:28:29.757 --> 00:28:30.724
Ok...


00:28:30.758 --> 00:28:33.522
First of all, I'm gonna be there with
you.


00:28:33.527 --> 00:28:35.654
And B, all you have to do is what your
teacher says.


00:28:35.763 --> 00:28:36.752
Play the pauses.


00:28:37.498 --> 00:28:38.465
It's easy... watch.


00:28:41.569 --> 00:28:42.558
See?


00:28:44.672 --> 00:28:46.469
I have to practice.


00:28:47.508 --> 00:28:48.475
Wait!


00:28:48.709 --> 00:28:50.540
Wu ji bi fan.


00:28:50.678 --> 00:28:51.667
What?


00:28:51.679 --> 00:28:53.579
I'm starting to think you don't speak
Chinese.


00:28:53.614 --> 00:28:55.479
Wu ji bi fan?


00:28:55.516 --> 00:28:57.575
Too much of good stuff is bad stuff?


00:28:57.751 --> 00:28:58.683
Ohh...


00:28:59.486 --> 00:29:00.578
Wu ji bi fan.


00:29:00.754 --> 00:29:04.520
Yeah... Wu ji bi fan.


00:29:04.592 --> 00:29:07.493
- C'mon
- Where are we going?


00:29:07.561 --> 00:29:08.721
- Have you been to the gym?
- No.


00:29:08.762 --> 00:29:10.525
C'mon, we're gonna have some fun.


00:29:11.532 --> 00:29:13.500
C'mon, I know you wanna go and have some
fun.


00:29:39.693 --> 00:29:40.625
Wow! Wow!


00:29:40.728 --> 00:29:43.595
Ok, that's gonna give you some serious
gas.


00:29:57.778 --> 00:29:59.507
What do you see?


00:30:01.582 --> 00:30:02.640
Now, what do you see?


00:30:02.650 --> 00:30:04.641
Me.


00:30:36.717 --> 00:30:38.617
Just dance.


00:31:39.780 --> 00:31:42.510
That's like... American dance.


00:31:42.516 --> 00:31:44.484
- You should have a group.
- No.


00:31:44.518 --> 00:31:47.715
With like other people in it and other
people dancing behind you.


00:31:47.721 --> 00:31:49.484
Doing the same stuff.


00:31:55.596 --> 00:31:56.460
Hello.


00:31:56.764 --> 00:31:57.696
I'm sorry.


00:31:58.699 --> 00:31:59.688
I know.


00:32:01.635 --> 00:32:04.604
The audition... It was changed to today.


00:32:04.605 --> 00:32:05.629
But they said it was tomorrow.


00:32:05.639 --> 00:32:06.606
Something happened.


00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:07.664
It's in twenty minutes.


00:32:07.708 --> 00:32:10.609
My father is coming to get me.


00:32:54.755 --> 00:32:56.450
Excuse me. I'm sorry.


00:32:58.559 --> 00:32:59.491
Excuse me. Coming through.


00:35:05.752 --> 00:35:08.653
Hey, she's like totally gonna get in,
right?


00:35:08.655 --> 00:35:10.486
Because that was just great.


00:35:43.690 --> 00:35:45.590
That was fantastic.


00:35:46.593 --> 00:35:49.562
That was... You just played it so
beautifully.


00:35:49.563 --> 00:35:52.760
We can no longer be friends.


00:35:54.701 --> 00:35:56.566
You are bad for my life.


00:36:09.716 --> 00:36:11.581
See you at the tournament.


00:36:11.618 --> 00:36:14.587
Don't be late for that.


00:36:58.665 --> 00:36:59.563
Mr. Han!


00:37:00.600 --> 00:37:01.567
Mr. Han!


00:37:06.606 --> 00:37:07.630
We not train today.


00:37:23.623 --> 00:37:24.681
What are you doing?


00:37:25.759 --> 00:37:27.624
It's June 8th.


00:38:37.497 --> 00:38:38.555
Why did you break the car?


00:38:57.517 --> 00:38:58.609
His name was Gang Gang.


00:39:01.588 --> 00:39:03.522
Xiao Dre, how old are you?


00:39:05.492 --> 00:39:06.459
Twelve.


00:39:07.561 --> 00:39:08.585
He was ten.


00:39:11.598 --> 00:39:12.724
She was so beautiful.


00:39:17.470 --> 00:39:18.494
Her name was Zhang.


00:39:20.674 --> 00:39:22.505
She was a singer.


00:39:26.646 --> 00:39:27.738
