00:40:08.622 --> 00:40:09.646
What happened?


00:40:19.566 --> 00:40:20.726
It was a steep hill.


00:40:22.535 --> 00:40:25.504
Last rain.


00:40:25.739 --> 00:40:28.503
The car... just...


00:40:29.776 --> 00:40:31.607
I was driving.


00:40:33.580 --> 00:40:35.673
