00:40:37.717 --> 00:40:38.775
I was so angry.


00:40:39.686 --> 00:40:41.620
I lost control.


00:40:43.556 --> 00:40:44.682
I try to remember.


00:40:46.693 --> 00:40:49.560
I cannot remember what we argued about.


00:40:50.697 --> 00:40:54.497
I hope it was something important.


00:40:56.703 --> 00:40:58.466
Every year.


00:40:58.505 --> 00:41:00.564
I fix the car.


00:41:02.575 --> 00:41:03.701
Still fix nothing


00:45:43.590 --> 00:45:44.579
Mr. Han!


00:47:31.764 --> 00:47:34.562
Win or lose, doesn't matter.


00:47:35.668 --> 00:47:37.533
Fight hard.


00:47:39.505 --> 00:47:41.564
Earn respect, boys leave you alone.


00:47:47.480 --> 00:47:48.572
