00:47:54.687 --> 00:47:57.622
Mr. Han Man...


00:47:57.657 --> 00:47:59.557
This is the one Bruce Lee had.


00:47:59.759 --> 00:48:00.691
Great.


00:48:02.628 --> 00:48:03.617
Thank you.


00:48:07.500 --> 00:48:09.730
You have taught me very important lesson,
Xiao Dre.


00:48:12.705 --> 00:48:14.673
Life will knock us down.


00:48:14.707 --> 00:48:17.733
But we can choose whether or not.


00:48:17.744 --> 00:48:19.678
To get back up.


00:48:22.715 --> 00:48:24.580
You're the best friend I've ever had,
Mr. Han.


00:48:42.735 --> 00:48:44.464
Ok.


00:48:47.673 --> 00:48:49.732
Wait, uh... Can you help me with
something?


00:48:55.615 --> 00:48:56.741
Dre?


00:48:57.583 --> 00:48:58.572
