00:49:04.490 --> 00:49:05.548
Sir...


00:49:06.659 --> 00:49:07.717
My name is Dre Parker,


00:49:09.562 --> 00:49:11.553
My actions have brought.


00:49:11.764 --> 00:49:15.598
Dishonor to your family.


00:49:16.636 --> 00:49:17.694
Your daughter,


00:49:17.737 --> 00:49:18.726
Has been,


00:49:19.505 --> 00:49:20.699
A great friend to me.


00:49:21.741 --> 00:49:23.641
And from her, I learned...


00:49:24.644 --> 00:49:26.578
That a true friend...


00:49:26.679 --> 00:49:29.546
is a person who makes your life better.


00:49:29.715 --> 00:49:31.580
I am willing to accept.


00:49:32.685 --> 00:49:34.550
Any consequences.


00:49:35.621 --> 00:49:37.555
If you are willing to give me,


00:49:37.657 --> 00:49:39.454
Another chance.


00:49:39.692 --> 00:49:41.523
I guarantee I will be,


00:49:43.496 --> 00:49:44.724
her true friend.


00:49:49.635 --> 00:49:50.659
That's it.


00:50:05.651 --> 00:50:07.516
My daughter told me,


00:50:07.520 --> 00:50:08.612
That she made a promise.


00:50:08.621 --> 00:50:10.589
To be at your tournament.


00:50:11.524 --> 00:50:12.582
In our family,


00:50:12.592 --> 00:50:14.617
We do not break our promises.


00:50:18.664 --> 00:50:19.688
Good luck!


00:50:23.569 --> 00:50:24.627
Xie Xie.


00:50:56.636 --> 00:50:58.729
Okay! Let the tournament begin!


00:51:17.690 --> 00:51:18.554
Stop!


00:51:23.596 --> 00:51:24.688
First round win by fighting dragon.


00:51:25.665 --> 00:51:27.758
Fighting dragon go to next round.


00:51:30.636 --> 00:51:31.568
- Please, enter there!
- Thank you.


00:51:31.671 --> 00:51:32.603
You next.


00:51:35.708 --> 00:51:37.573
- What's that?
- Rule book.


00:51:38.578 --> 00:51:39.476
You don't know the rules?


00:51:39.545 --> 00:51:40.512
Of course I know the rules.


00:51:40.713 --> 00:51:43.546
Simple, you hit him Don't let him hit
you.


00:51:44.483 --> 00:51:45.450
What?


00:51:45.685 --> 00:51:47.448
Mr...


00:51:47.486 --> 00:51:48.453
They're gonna kill me.


00:51:48.487 --> 00:51:49.579
Ah...


00:51:49.589 --> 00:51:51.523
Two points to win.


00:51:51.724 --> 00:51:52.691
Go!


00:51:53.526 --> 00:51:54.652
Hit him two times... Focus! Focus!


00:52:01.534 --> 00:52:02.523
Respect!


00:52:08.674 --> 00:52:09.572
Get ready!


00:52:21.721 --> 00:52:22.745
Don't get out of the mat.


00:52:24.624 --> 00:52:25.488
That's a warning.


00:52:25.591 --> 00:52:26.580
You cannot run out of the mat.


00:52:26.692 --> 00:52:27.681
Next time you loose a point.


00:52:28.594 --> 00:52:29.492
Go!


00:52:29.595 --> 00:52:30.527
Fight! Be strong!


00:52:30.730 --> 00:52:31.628
C'mon Dre!


00:52:32.598 --> 00:52:33.462
Start!


00:52:42.708 --> 00:52:43.697
Get out! Don't allow!


00:52:44.577 --> 00:52:45.669
Red! One point!


00:52:55.621 --> 00:52:56.645
Blue! One Point!


00:53:05.598 --> 00:53:07.498
Good job! Next time no face!


00:53:07.533 --> 00:53:09.524
- Sorry, I can't help it
- Ok, ok


00:53:09.535 --> 00:53:10.502
Make for winner.


00:53:11.504 --> 00:53:12.528
C'mon baby!


00:53:17.710 --> 00:53:18.608
Begin!


00:54:29.782 --> 00:54:31.613
That's right baby!


00:55:54.466 --> 00:55:57.458
Dre Parker has advanced
to the semi-final.


00:55:58.637 --> 00:56:00.696
From now on, semi-final matches.


00:56:00.739 --> 00:56:01.763
Three points to win.


00:56:02.608 --> 00:56:04.633
It'd be kinda hot if I won this thing,
right, Mr. Han?


00:56:04.677 --> 00:56:06.645
Lt'd be kinda hot if you focus.


00:56:07.546 --> 00:56:08.706
Yeah, well, after that...


00:56:19.558 --> 00:56:21.719
And now the first semi-final of the evening.


00:58:16.508 --> 00:58:19.739
Next semi-final introducing Fighting
Dragon, Liang.


00:58:22.481 --> 00:58:25.541
And the surprise finalist, Dre Parker.


00:58:33.759 --> 00:58:36.660
Empty your mind. Focus!


00:59:33.485 --> 00:59:34.713
Get out! You disqualified!


00:59:39.625 --> 00:59:40.523
Be still!


00:59:40.726 --> 00:59:41.522
Xiao Dre.


00:59:42.561 --> 00:59:43.528
You're okay?


00:59:57.743 --> 00:59:58.732
Is it serious?


00:59:58.777 --> 01:00:00.540
He cannot resume the competition.


01:00:02.581 --> 01:00:03.639
Please do take good care to recover.


01:00:03.649 --> 01:00:06.641
You have brought honor to your family.


01:00:09.721 --> 01:00:10.745
Doctor says...


01:00:10.756 --> 01:00:12.519
You did great.


01:00:14.660 --> 01:00:15.627
Xie Xie.


01:00:22.601 --> 01:00:23.590
You ok, baby?


01:00:23.635 --> 01:00:24.693
Yeah, I'm ok.


01:00:27.773 --> 01:00:30.537
Dre Parker has 2 minutes to return to the
match.


01:00:31.577 --> 01:00:33.545
