01:00:34.513 --> 01:00:37.505
The Fighting Dragons win by default.


01:00:39.751 --> 01:00:41.548
Can you guys give us a second?


01:00:43.655 --> 01:00:45.589
Yeah, ok... Sure.


01:00:45.591 --> 01:00:46.615
Baby, whatever you need.


01:00:55.634 --> 01:00:56.726
Do you think I coulïve won?


01:00:59.505 --> 01:01:01.496
Win or lose, doesn't matter, Xiao Dre.


01:01:02.641 --> 01:01:04.609
You know that's not what I mean.


01:01:09.715 --> 01:01:11.512
Yes.


01:01:11.517 --> 01:01:13.576
I think you had a good chance.


01:01:16.488 --> 01:01:18.479
So, let's do the fiery cup thing.


01:01:21.593 --> 01:01:22.753
You don't need to fight anymore.


01:01:24.496 --> 01:01:26.521
You have proven everything you need to
prove.


01:01:26.532 --> 01:01:29.558
What? That I can get beat up easy and
then quit?


01:01:29.735 --> 01:01:32.602
That's not balance, that's not real Kung
Fu.


01:01:32.638 --> 01:01:35.539
You said that when life knocks you down.


01:01:35.574 --> 01:01:37.769
You could choose whether or not to get
back up.


01:01:38.744 --> 01:01:41.645
Well I'm trying to get back up Why won't
you help me?


01:01:44.616 --> 01:01:45.583
Because...


01:01:46.652 --> 01:01:48.677
I cannot watch you get hurt anymore.


01:01:52.758 --> 01:01:54.487
Please Mr. Han.


01:01:55.661 --> 01:01:57.458
Please!


01:01:58.530 --> 01:01:59.554
Just tell me Xiao Dre.


01:01:59.565 --> 01:02:00.554
Why?


01:02:01.533 --> 01:02:03.524
Why do you need to go back out there so
badly?


01:02:07.639 --> 01:02:09.539
'Cos I'm still scared.


01:02:11.777 --> 01:02:13.472
No matter what happens...


01:02:14.546 --> 01:02:15.672
Tonight, when I leave.


01:02:16.682 --> 01:02:18.547
I don't wanna be scared anymore.


01:02:32.531 --> 01:02:35.557
Since Dre Parker has not returned to the
ring.


01:02:36.602 --> 01:02:37.500
Wait!


01:02:37.603 --> 01:02:38.592
Dre Parker will fight.


01:02:39.571 --> 01:02:40.469
Wait!


01:02:47.512 --> 01:02:48.501
Dre Parker will fight!


01:02:54.753 --> 01:02:57.745
Dre Parker will fight!


01:04:46.531 --> 01:04:47.498
Xiao Dre!


01:05:03.682 --> 01:05:05.582
C'mon Dre! You can do this, Dre!


01:05:12.691 --> 01:05:13.589
Begin!


01:05:46.658 --> 01:05:47.590
Begin!


01:06:41.713 --> 01:06:43.681
- You ok?
- I'm ok.


01:06:47.619 --> 01:06:48.608
No mercy.


01:07:56.588 --> 01:08:00.456
The score is tied, the next point wins!


01:09:49.601 --> 01:09:50.499
Blue! One Point!


01:09:51.636 --> 01:09:53.433
Blue is the winner.


01:10:45.490 --> 01:10:47.458
I'm so proud of you.


01:11:03.675 --> 01:11:04.607
Master!

